sequenceDiagram
    participant ID as Identity Service
    participant K as Kafka
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as Notification DB
    participant Mail as SMTP / Log Email Sender
    participant DLQ as Retry / DLQ Topic

    ID->>K: Publish verification or reset event
    K-->>NS: Consume event
    NS->>DB: Check inbox_processed_events
    alt Event already processed
        NS-->>K: Commit offset
    else New event
        NS->>Mail: Send email
        alt Send success
            Mail-->>NS: Provider message id
            NS->>DB: INSERT delivery_log
            NS->>DB: INSERT inbox_processed_event
            NS-->>K: Commit offset
        else Send failed
            Mail-->>NS: Error
            NS->>DB: INSERT failed delivery_log
            NS->>DLQ: Publish retry or DLQ message
        end
    end
